# Copy to screenshots/.env (gitignored). Never commit a real hostname or model name.
#
# Real inference without leaking the endpoint (relay mode): set the real https:// base URL and
# the model id it serves. The forwarder (compose/forwarder.yml) presents it inside the stack as
# http://llm.example.internal:8081 with the model id demo-model.
# INFERENCE_UPSTREAM=https://inference.internal.example
# INFERENCE_UPSTREAM_MODEL=the-real-model-id
#
# Or point netclaw straight at an endpoint (external mode; it ends up in netclaw.json, so don't
# capture provider lists this way). Without either, the stack uses a tiny local Ollama model.
# INFERENCE_BASE_URL=http://llm.example.internal:8080
# INFERENCE_MODEL_ID=your-model-id
